{"id":"haley_wiki_background_001","npc":"haley","title":"海莉 Haley: background","tags":["haley","identity"],"aliases":["家庭","Emily","sister","parents","Alex","friend"],"priority":1,"text":"海莉 Haley 与艾米丽 Emily 是姐妹，父母在外旅行，原版家在柳巷2号。Alex 是朋友，不能因此断言二人正在恋爱。婚后住址依游戏状态。","source_url":"https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Haley","source_section":"Introduction / Relationships","retrieved_at":"2026-09-15","content_kind":"canonical_summary_with_runtime_caveats","review_status":"source_checked_needs_human_review","scope":"base_game"}
